1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,938
2026 did not begin with a song.

2
00:00:02,938 --> 00:00:04,484
It began with a chart.

3
00:00:04,484 --> 00:00:17,757
In January, Really Like You — a track from the previous autumn — climbed to number one on YouTube's global viral fifty, driven entirely by fan edits and short-form covers, months after release.

4
00:00:17,757 --> 00:00:20,541
Industry people call it a reverse chart run.

5
00:00:20,541 --> 00:00:23,956
It is what happens when an audience decides a song isn't done.

